Required Verification Sequence:

Measurement 01: Actual Component Dry Mass

Unlocks: Frame dead load, component CG (Center of Gravity) coordinates.

Result: Resolves structural dead weight calculation error to candidate margin of error.

Measurement 02: Scale Buoyancy Displacement

Unlocks: Static water displacement of a single sealed drum under incremental loading.

Result: Resolves theoretical drum displacement vs. actual waterline.

Measurement 03: Frame Racking Test

Unlocks: frame racking/torsion behavior.

Result: Establishes how well the chassis resists twisting when suspended by opposite corners.

